{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>They shall not…</b> When they return to Zion." "<b>Fiery heat.</b> Like חֹרֶב, 'and the glowing sand' (Isaiah 35:7); and [it means] the striking of the sun, like 'the sun shall not strike them by day' (Psalms 121:6)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:42.163601754Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}